  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 204.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to provide a uniform procedure for the conduct of public hearings and comment concerning rulemaking.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Liq 200) #13992, eff 5-31-24",
